sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant GW as Gateway API
  participant OP as oauth2-proxy
  participant KC as Keycloak
  participant OD as Odoo

  U->>GW: HTTPS /web/database/manager
  GW->>OP: Route to oauth2-proxy
  OP->>KC: OIDC auth
  KC-->>OP: Token
  OP->>OD: Forward request (authorized)
  OD-->>U: Response

  U->>GW: HTTPS /
  GW->>OD: Route to Odoo
  OD-->>U: Response
